<title>USA: Bergen Brunswig sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>Bergen Brunswig sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergen Brunswig Corp set it set a five-for-four stock split, to be paid in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend on June 2, to shareholders of record May 5.</p>
<p>It also said it will continue to pay its current $0.12 per share dividend, which will in effect be a 25 percent increase, after the spit becomes effective.</p>
</text>
